  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Apoyo y fomento al desarrollo de la estrategia regional de empredimiento, innovaci&#xf3;n y desarrollo empresarial en pa&#xed;ses de Mesoam&#xe9;rica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Based on the proven experience developed by Colombia, the project aims at promoting entrepreneurship and innovation, improving business environment and creating opportunities for SME&apos;s in Mesoamerica. It will strengthen institutions that support business development, including through public/private partnership and develop an integrated service delivery business model in the region.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
